// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P134473252" "We gots us a situation out in Potter's Field, {VillainName}. An expensive situation. The Consortium's been trying to get the area surveyed for bauxite deposits for the last few months, but every time we send a surveyor in, the guy disappears! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>No one knows where they're going or who's responsible, but I want you to crack some heads until you find out.</a> That sound like something you can handle?"
// AcceptString :
"P2957314288" "Find out what's happening to the surveyors"
// SendOffString :
"P503697808" "The last surveyor disappeared near a cave structure close to the graveyard, You should start there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P509703625" "Seek clues to disappearance"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1161703407" "The Consortium needs to know what's happening to those surveyors. They don't come free, you know?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1848679551" "If a surveyor wandered into these dank caverns alone, he probably deserved to be abducted."

