"P819418513" "So, our surveyors have been falling into the hands of the Circle. Hmm. We're going to have to stop this, {VillainName}. I gotta let Kirk Cage know I can handle things like this!"
// RandomFameString :
"P485157064" "I hear {VillainName} stopped some Circle ritual. That's moxie!"

