// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2428311269" "Ok, ok, I can figure this out. The Circle wants people for their ceremonies. Check. We keep sending people into Potter's Field to survey. Check. The Circle kidnaps our guys. That's the bad part. Now, this is hard: how do I keep the surveyors alive without getting into a war with the Circle? Gotta think. Gotta be real smart now. <br><br>What if we give the Circle someone else for their ceremonies? Some Scrapyarders, say? Then they'd be happy, Cage'd be happy, the surveyors would be alive, and the Scrapyarders... well, they wouldn't be causing trouble anymore. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you kidnap a few Scrapyarders for me, {VillainName}?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P1037139774" "Kidnap a few Scrapyarders"
// SendOffString :
"P15119307" "Kirk Cage'd be proud to see us working together, {VillainName}. We sure make a good team."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3172328029" "Kidnap problem Scrapyarders"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3749158692" "There are four guys in that hideout you want to take down, {VillainName}. You gotta get every one."

