// Dialog :
"P1240522142" "So, the Scrapyarders figured out what we were after and beat you to the punch, eh? Looks like all they did was stir up a big nest of trouble for themselves. After you helped them in that battle, it won't be hard at all to convince the Circle to lay off Cage's surveyors in favor of the Scrapyarders. I'll have those Scrapyarder leaders you kidnapped driven out to Potter's Field pronto; I'm sure the Circle will be happy to have them. Good work, {VillainName}. Cage wins again, and that makes everybody happy."
